      "sourceTextSha256": "9fc2f3d6df9f72772bbc4461dbcef100d40b6493cc4dc212e1d928daa07ba0de",
      "text": "From Bogotá’s museums and the cloud forest of Chicaque to the colourful river of Caño Cristales. In 8 days, you will explore the river’s upper and lower basins, travel by canoe on the Guayabero and spend 3 nights at La Manigua nature lodge.",
